{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You\u2019re not a hero.\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re just someone who woke up in a cold, broken world: with no memory, no future, and maybe no hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you figure out who you were?<br>Will you survive long enough to matter? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a post-apocalyptic town filled with factions, decay, and uncomfortable choices. Hunt rats, sell their meat, go mad from hunger, or maybe-somehow start a business.<br>Violence is  risky. Even rats can kill you.<br>Money talks. Water is a privilege. And death? Always an option.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who are you,</strong> and do you even care about the answer? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong><br> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > nonlinear story with many endings</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >companions with strong personalities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >dark humor &amp; grim choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >economy-focused survival (money and resources)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >post-apocalyptic farming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >rats. many rats. some hate you. one might love you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >grinding poverty and insanity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>free demo included</strong> (first 3 days,  saves compatible with the full game)</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2945800?t=1749947166","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2945800?t=1749947166","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945800/1c62dd95c7d738706a684acb194d1b72ca3e08ff/capsule_